      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Double Slice",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Hrungul makes a longsword Strike, followed by a shield boss Strike against the same target at a –2 penalty, each using his current multiple attack penalty. If both attacks hit, he combines their damage and applies resistances and weaknesses only once. This counts as two attacks when calculating his multiple attack penalty.",
